{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20230","headline":"峡哀 六 · 孟郊","name":"峡哀 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谗人峡虯心，渴罪呀然浔。\n所食无直肠，所语饶枭音。\n石齿嚼百泉，石风号千琴。\n幽哀莫能远，分雪何由寻。\n月魄高卓卓，峡窟清沉沉。\n衔诉何时明，抱痛已不禁。\n犀飞空波涛，裂石千嶔岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}